{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "68", "x": 0.9032117274603759, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03053152114325986, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Example overview", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.19398802898134385, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "These plans of the farm illustrate the updated facilities that have been added", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8260367092647597, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "since 1950, which include accommodation, power generation and other additions", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8258376058044707, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to appeal to visitors and holidaymakers.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.40770557560431026, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Essay [ Candidate Essay]", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.26499186515754036, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.7314810457504278, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In today's world, education is a must to every child and individual across every", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.321989731029874, "w": 0.8068979916694374, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "country. The duration of summer holidays became a major thing in terms of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3503200811040116, "w": 0.8068978891444836, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "priority in some countries like in middle eastern location. Where as cold", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3786504311781492, "w": 0.807629404689881, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "countries which experience long winters have concentrated less on summer", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4069808189736794, "w": 0.8069634025899649, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "holidays giving only few weeks for summer vacations.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4353112067692095, "w": 0.5492093121775141, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "On the otherside, a regular family would like to spend most of the time in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4636415568433471, "w": 0.806919726959644, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "summer holidays by travelling to their homeland, meeting their relatives and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4919966521509719, "w": 0.8074525491445677, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "seek long durations for summer, so that children can spend valuable time with", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.520327039946502, "w": 0.8069196244346902, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cousins and relatives making valuable memories. On the other hand, some", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5486573900206396, "w": 0.806963300065011, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "parents who work 365 days would find it difficult to take care of children during", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5769877778161697, "w": 0.8077059908303732, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "summer holidays as they have to work and prefer shorter period of holidays.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6053181278903074, "w": 0.7742143692208606, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This has become a major problem and is affecting children in a bad way.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.633648477964445, "w": 0.8069414622498506, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Childhood is to cherish some good valuable memories along with studies.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6620160213315983, "w": 0.8068542135141628, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Longer summer breaks allow the children to make time to visit family relatives", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.8072673890779961, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and this early relationship helps to maintain a stronger bond for the rest of the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7186767214798736, "w": 0.8068979916694374, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "life. Once they are out of school, they have to work and make a living for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7468587510386585, "w": 0.8067890076435429, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "themselves where they won't find time for their loved ones.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7751891011127962, "w": 0.6042889468975078, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Coming to shorter school holidays, they help the children from falling back in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8035195266297188, "w": 0.80683258074891, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "studies (or) having interest. With longer duration of holidays children take a lot", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8318498767038565, "w": 0.8070068731703781, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of time to get back their concentration after the school starts. It has both", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8602049720114812, "w": 0.8070501387008837, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "positive and negative side to it. Shorter school holidays help the student to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8885353220856188, "w": 0.8069846252554025, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}